The integrated triangle coefficient construction in unmanaged_bitmap_filter.hpp
was adapted from Microsoft's DirectXTex Filters::CreateTriangleFilter algorithm:
https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXTex/blob/main/DirectXTex/filters.h
